// Reusable library node (execution_plan §11.1): set the held item down on a surveyed support. `release_constraint`
// and `item` are the contract's optional arguments (openral_ext/capability_server/contracts.yaml); "below_overhang"
// matches the spare ORU's T-shaped bail (catalogue interface, F78) and what Ours called on this covered instance
// (R/artifacts/runs/g8s, g8t).
//
// Result comes back through `ok` (InOut); see lib/DriveAndDock.ple for why not node outcome.
//
// Nominal path only -- no retry yet. place's reported failure kinds and stages (over, lower, release, retreat,
// settle) are still moving in a parallel session; see docs/baselines/plexil.md for the recovery set, TBD.

Boolean Command place(String, String, String);

PlaceItem:
{
  In String support;
  In String release_constraint;
  In String item;
  InOut Boolean ok;

  Place: { PreCondition ok; EndCondition isKnown(ok); PostCondition ok; ok = place(support, release_constraint, item); }
}
